description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests a formal, XSS-safe email subject
  and branded HTML body composed from facts already in the conversation and handed
  to the available email-sending tool (any subject matter such as reports, summaries,
  findings, case lists, or alerts). Examples: "draft an email", "email me the findings",
  "mail this to the SOC lead". Do not activate for generating the underlying report/summary
  content (route that to the matching content skill first), chat, or ticketing and
  other messaging channels.'
